<title>USA: Kaiser Ventures Inc Q4 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Kaiser Ventures Inc Q4 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>ONTARIO, Calif. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>KAISER VENTURES INC.</p>
<p>				 FINANCIAL HIGHLIGHTS</p>
<p>				 FOR THE YEARS ENDED</p>
<p>				 AND AS OF DECEMBER 31</p>
<p>						   1996		 1995</p>
<p> Total revenues			$15,414,000	$11,108,000</p>
<p> Operating costs &amp; expenses	  7,149,000	  7,993,000</p>
<p> Net interest expense		    819,000	    665,000</p>
<p>Income before income tax provision:</p>
<p>					     7,446,000	  2,450,000</p>
<p>Income tax provision:</p>
<p>    Currently payable		     92,000		  ---</p>
<p>    Deferred tax expense		 840,000	    721,000</p>
<p>Deferred tax expense credited</p>
<p>     to equity			   3,945,000	    335,000</p>
<p> Net income				2,569,000	  1,394,000</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income per share in 1996 was $0.24 vs $0.13 in 1995.</p>
</text>
